# BMW 7 Series F01/F02 four-door saloon, 2008-2015.
#
# The F01 7-series (F02 long wheelbase, the volume form in Britain): 5,072 mm
# long, 1,902 mm wide, 1,479 mm high, 3,070 mm wheelbase (F02 3,215). 3.0-6.0
# petrol and 3.0 diesel, the 730d the volume model. Facelift in 2012.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_7_Series_(F01)
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Titanium Silver, Imperial Blue and Alpine White are
# documented BMW finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 20 in total (black 8, silver 6, blue 3, white 3).
#
# Speed 250 km/h; comfort 170/435 (line). Class 4.
# Dates: 2008-2015 with a road tail to about 2028.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-f01.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-f01/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

